Israel War Crimes argues that Israel's actions in Gaza are genocidal. Israel's war on Gaza is alarming and worrisome. Israel is responsible for killing civilians in Gaza. Zionism Condemned argues that Zionism inflicts harm on Palestinians and Arabs. Zionism is used to justify violence and ethnic cleansing.

@marygillis.bsky.social: “Framing this as a result of the "fragility" of the system rather than a direct result of Israel's genocidal actions is a choice. One that other outlets managed to avoid making.”

Israel War Crimes (56%) says Israel commits war crimes in Gaza. Zionism Condemned (44%) says Zionism is racist.

City Guilt argues that City's hypocrisy is evident in their cheating. City is trying to whip up a PR campaign. The Premier League's credibility is undermined by City's breaches. City's guilt sparks calls for severe sanctions. The football authorities are not ready for the backlash against City. City Condemned argues that City's spending harms other clubs. City's financial dealings are unfair to fans. City's actions undermine the league's financial rules. Premier League Cheating argues that cheating undermines the Premier League.

@karatejesus44.bsky.social: “This whole ‘poor city fans’ thing you see everywhere is increasingly pissing me off. How about feeling sorry for fans of all the other clubs who have been completely fucked over by city. Of one of many examples, look at the state of Leicester now.”

City Guilt (43.9%) says Manchester City is guilty of breaches. City Condemned (29.3%) says City is criticized for financial dealings. Premier League Cheating (26.8%) says Cheating undermines the Premier League.

Fuel Price Impact argues that Trump's fuel economy rollback increases long-term risk. High gas prices benefit US oil companies and Trump regime insiders. Diesel Crisis argues that Diesel prices are unstable. Trump Causes Inflation argues that Trump's strong-arming causes price increases. Trump's policies are ineffective and raise prices. Trump's actions lose Republican votes. Trump's rejection of ceasefire raises oil prices.

@scotiasheppard.bsky.social: “What an idiot. That product will not impact gas prices, and it’s theft.”

Fuel Price Impact (43.4%) says Trump's policies affect fuel prices. Diesel Crisis (33.3%) says Diesel prices are unstable. Trump Causes Inflation (23.3%) says Trump's actions increase oil prices.

AI Model Delayed argues that OpenAI scraps AI model release over safety concerns. Openai Anthropic Models argues that AI models may be flawed.

@markfollman.bsky.social: “Story after story right now about OpenAI models failing on safety, but it’s all been in the context of cybersecurity. What about ChatGPT fueling school shooters? We just published a major investigation exposing that further and the details are beyond disturbing”

AI Model Delayed (86.1%) says OpenAI scraps AI model release over safety concerns. Openai Anthropic Models (13.9%) says AI models may be flawed.
